Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790351999999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790294399999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The strongest counterargument is that the trend keeps producing spiking highs that are not held: bar 86 reached 2771 with a 255.70-point upper tail and was followed by 27 sideways bars, and bar 117 now shows the same shape with high 2850 and close 2775.61 (74.39-point tail), so the current 'breakout' may be another overshoot rather than a durable spike.", "Trading-range behaviour dominates the window: bars 11-35, 50-83 and 87-113 are three multi-week ranges covering roughly 86 of 120 bars, so this market has repeatedly reverted to range after every strong leg, which weakens a trend-continuation label.", "The pullback is large relative to the leg: 216.69 points (~7.6%) from 2850 to 2633.31 in only three bars, and bar 119's low 2641.37 undercuts the low 2641.70 of the breakout bar 117, a sign that the spike's momentum is already being absorbed.", "The last 20 bars are only net +207 (bar 101 close 2479.28 to bar 120 close 2686.59) while containing both a new high 2850 and a deep dip to 2358.62 (bar 111), i.e., two-sided rather than one-directional pressure."], "evidence_for": ["Acceptance above a multi-week range: four consecutive closes (2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90, 2775.61) above the 2557.46 top of the 27-bar bars 87-113 range, with a new window high at 2850 (bar 117).", "Swing progression is upward across the window: higher lows 1368.42 -> 1512.91 -> 1803.74 -> 2357.18 paired with higher highs 1944.39 -> 1974.46 -> 2771 -> 2850.", "The pullback after the breakout is being bought above the breakout level: bars 118-120 hold low 2633.31, and bar 120 closes 2686.59, 129 points above 2557.46 and in the upper 81% of its own 66.08 range.", "The 27-bar range (bars 87-113) resolved upward with follow-through bars 115 and 116 (closes 2632.98 and 2642.90) rather than immediately reversing, unlike the failed bar 61 (1974.46) and bar 107 (2680) probes inside earlier ranges."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window covers 120 closed D1 bars from open 1779926400000 to the final close 1790294399999; window low is 1368.42 (bar 10, close 1780790399999) and window high is 2850 (bar 117, close 1789948800000), a 108% advance from low to high.", "Bars 6-10 are five consecutive lower closes (1859.02, 1813.04, 1731.00, 1581.32, 1568.55), breaking the bars 1-5 range of 1958.77-2042.37; bar 6 opens 2006.06 with high 2006.17 and closes 1859.02.", "Bar 10 prints the window low 1368.42 but closes 1568.55, a 200.13-point lower tail (87% of its 230.85 range) - a climactic reversal bar rather than a clean bear trend bar.", "Bars 11-35 are two-sided and overlapping between high 1845.09 (bar 19) and low 1512.91 (bar 30); bar 30's 1512.91 is a higher low versus 1368.42.", "Bars 36-49 rally from 1597.72 (bar 36 low) to 1944.39 (bar 49 high) with consecutive bull closes 1889.93 and 1917.02 (bars 48-49).", "Bars 50-83 form a 34-bar overlapping range between 1803.74 (bar 51 low) and 1974.46 (bar 61 high); bar 61 opens 1953.92, tags 1974.46 and closes 1891.41, and bars 73 and 80 have ranges of only 13.24 and 10.41 (doji cluster).", "Bars 84-86 are a bull spike: bar 84 opens 1916.51 with low 1905.63 and closes 2252.16; bar 86 prints high 2771 but closes 2515.30, leaving a 255.70-point upper tail.", "Bars 87-113 hold a 27-bar range between 2357.18 (bar 98 low) and 2557.46 (bar 92 high); bar 107 spikes to 2680 and closes 2514.72 back inside the range.", "Bars 114-117 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 and 2775.61, all above the 2557.46 range high, and bar 117 reaches the new window high 2850.", "Bars 118-120 pull back from bar 118 high 2776.18 to bar 120 low 2633.31; bar 119's low 2641.37 undercuts bar 117's low 2641.70, and bar 120 closes 2686.59 (81% of its 66.08 range) still 129 points above the 2557.46 breakout level."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bear breakout of the bars 1-5 range 1958.77-2042.37, with five consecutive bear closes down to the 1368.42 low; bar 6 opens 2006.06 and closes 1859.02, bar 10 closes 1568.55.", "end_time_ms": 1780790399999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780358400000, "upper_boundary": "2042.37"}, {"description": "Sell-climax reversal bar at the 1368.42 low: close 1568.55 with a 200.13-point lower tail, ending the bear spike and starting the basing process.", "end_time_ms": 1780790399999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780704000000, "upper_boundary": "1599.27"}, {"description": "Post-spike two-sided range with heavy overlap and alternating closes; high 1845.09 (bar 19), higher low 1512.91 (bar 30), roughly 1500-1850 area.", "end_time_ms": 1783036799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1845.09"}, {"description": "Bull leg from the 1597.72 low (bar 36) to the 1944.39 high (bar 49), continued by a pullback low of 1803.74 (bar 51).", "end_time_ms": 1784073599999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1597.72", "start_time_ms": 1782950400000, "upper_boundary": "1944.39"}, {"description": "34-bar overlapping range between 1803.74 (bar 51 low) and 1974.46 (bar 61 high); the bar 61 probe above 1974.46 failed and closed 1891.41, and bars 73 and 80 are very small doji bars.", "end_time_ms": 1787097600000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1803.74", "start_time_ms": 1784160000000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike out of the 1800-1975 range: bar 84 rises from 1916.51 to close 2252.16, and bar 86 spikes to 2771 before closing 2515.30 (buy climax with a 255.70-point upper tail).", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "27-bar range after the spike between 2357.18 (bar 98 low) and 2557.46 (bar 92 high); bar 107 overshoots to 2680 but closes 2514.72 back inside the range.", "end_time_ms": 1789689599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2557.46"}, {"description": "Four-bar breakout above the 2557.46 range top: closes 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 and 2775.61, with bar 117 printing the window high 2850 (74.39-point upper tail).", "end_time_ms": 1789948800000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789689600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Three-bar pullback from bar 118 high 2776.18 to bar 120 low 2633.31 that holds above the 2557.46 breakout level; bar 119's low 2641.37 undercuts bar 117's low 2641.70 and bar 120 closes 2686.59 near the top of its range.", "end_time_ms": 1790294399999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790035200000, "upper_boundary": "2776.18"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Two or more consecutive closes above 2776.18 (bar 118 high) would confirm the bars 114-117 leg as a continuing spike and keep the read as bull breakout.", "A daily close back below 2557.46 (the bars 87-113 range top) would mark the breakout as failed and revert the primary read to trading-range with an upper boundary near 2850.", "A close below bar 120's low 2633.31 followed by a lower high below 2776.18 would shift the always-in to short and raise the higher-high MTR-like interpretation of 2771 versus 2850.", "Continued overlapping closes between roughly 2633 and 2776 with small bodies would move the phase from breakout-spike toward channel or range without changing the bullish regime label."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790337599999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["A lower high now exists: 2804.59 (bar 99), 2786.81 (bar 107), 2776.18 (bar 100) - the classic onset of a trading range or MTR near the highs rather than clean continuation.", "Bar 96 spiked to 2850.00 and closed 2723.15, a 126.85 upper tail: buy-climax behavior in which the strongest bull bar of the leg was immediately sold.", "The last 21 bars are net sideways-to-lower (about 2775 area to 2715.90) with heavy overlap and a 15-bar, 6.1% pullback, which is range behavior; a strong bull trend typically pulls back shallowly for only a few bars.", "Bar 120 left a 24.52 upper tail and closed about 64.6% up its 69.24 range rather than at its high, so the 2699-2700 break was partly sold back and has no follow-through bar.", "Bar 109 was a 67.71 body bear bar closing 10.51 above its low, showing traders willing to sell hard below the 2740-2700 zone.", "Roughly the first 78 of the 120 bars were range-bound between about 2440 and 2530, so the window as a whole is only partially trending."], "evidence_for": ["Unbroken higher-low sequence across the up move: 2358.62 (bar 62), 2370.54 (bar 68), 2435.71 (bar 73), 2486.12/2495.82, 2568.16 (bar 90), 2633.31 (bar 114) - each pullback low is above the prior one.", "Bull breakout bars are large and close near their highs (bar 79 2507.15-2578.60, bar 96 2658.81-2723.15, bar 94 2642.90-2664.73), the behavior of a trend that is still being bought.", "The 2358.62 low was a spike low that closed 54.33 above its low and was followed by a higher low at 2370.54 and then an advance of roughly 20.8% to 2850.00, so the reversal from that low is established, not speculative.", "The pullback low 2633.31 sits 65.15 above the prior swing low 2568.16, so the structural requirement for a continuing bull trend (higher low) is still satisfied.", "The final bar (open 2671.44, low 2671.18) closed 2715.90, above the 2699.53 ceiling of the ten-bar range, with only a 0.26 lower tail - within that bar buyers controlled the outcome."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed H4 bars, 1788609600000 to 1790323200000; first close 2458.65, last close 2715.90 (net +10.46%).", "Window extremes: high 2850.00 (bar 96, 1789977600000), low 2358.62 (bar 62, 1789488000000).", "Bars 1-36 traded mostly between about 2440 and 2530; the only probe down to 2411.04 (bar 31) closed back at 2440.20, so that range held.", "Bar 37 (open 2457.12) spiked to 2680 above the range high 2528.8 (bar 10) but closed 2555.52, a 124.48 upper tail; bars 38-39 fell back to 2506.68 area, so the breakout was not accepted.", "Bars 38-57 overlapped between 2464.27 and roughly 2545; bar 57 tested 2609.02 and closed 2514.07 (large upper tail).", "Bars 61-62 dropped from 2484.35 to 2358.62; bar 62 closed 2412.95, 54.33 above its low, a spike low with buying below.", "Bars 63-99 are a strong bull sequence: higher low 2370.54 (bar 68) versus 2358.62 (bar 62), an intermediate pullback low 2568.16 (bar 90), then highs 2700 (bar 94), 2850.00 (bar 96, upper tail 126.85) and 2804.59 (bar 99).", "Bars 100-109 pulled back to 2648.49; bar 109 was a 67.71 body bear bar closing 2659.00, 10.51 above its low, and bar 107 made a lower high 2786.81 versus 2804.59.", "Bars 110-119 formed a tight overlapping range between 2633.31 (bar 114) and 2699.53 (bar 118), about 2.5% wide, with descending closes 2694.09, 2686.59, 2677.28, 2671.19.", "Bar 120 (open 2671.44, low 2671.18) broke to 2740.42 and closed 2715.90, 16.37 above the 2699.53 ceiling, but left a 24.52 upper tail; no follow-through bar yet."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Early-window trading range; most bars held roughly 2440-2530 with one probe to 2411.04 that closed back at 2440.20 (failed breakout keeping the range intact).", "end_time_ms": 1789113600000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2411.04", "start_time_ms": 1788609600000, "upper_boundary": "2528.8"}, {"description": "Bull spike bar 37 (2457.12 open, 2680 high, 2555.52 close) cleared the 2528.8 range high but left a 124.48 upper tail and bars 38-39 gave back to 2506.68; breakout attempt without acceptance.", "end_time_ms": 1789156800000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2444.19", "start_time_ms": 1789128000000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Bars 38-57 chopped with heavy overlap between 2464.27 and roughly 2545; the 2609.02 high of bar 57 was immediately rejected with a 2514.07 close.", "end_time_ms": 1789416000000, "kind": "two-sided", "lower_boundary": "2464.27", "start_time_ms": 1789142400000, "upper_boundary": "2609.02"}, {"description": "Sell climax: bars 61-62 fell from 2484.35 to 2358.62, and bar 62 closed 2412.95, 54.33 above its low, with a higher low 2370.54 following at bar 68.", "end_time_ms": 1789502400000, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789473600000, "upper_boundary": "2484.35"}, {"description": "Bull trend leg from the 2358.62/2370.54 base to the 2804.59 high with an intermediate pullback to 2568.16 (bar 90); legs contain large bull bars closing near their highs (bar 79 2507.15-2578.60).", "end_time_ms": 1790020800000, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2370.54", "start_time_ms": 1789516800000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}, {"description": "Buy climax: bar 96 spiked to 2850.00 and closed 2723.15, a 126.85 upper tail, immediately followed by a stall and then the pullback.", "end_time_ms": 1789992000000, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "2658.06", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Pullback leg from the 2804.59 high to 2648.49 with a lower high 2786.81 (bar 107); the low holds 80.33 above the 2568.16 higher low, so the bull trend's higher-low sequence is intact.", "end_time_ms": 1790164800000, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2648.49", "start_time_ms": 1790035200000, "upper_boundary": "2786.81"}, {"description": "Tight 10-bar range 2633.31-2699.53 (about 2.5% wide) with overlapping bars and descending closes; bar 120 exceeded the ceiling to 2740.42 and closed 2715.90, an unconfirmed upside break of the range.", "end_time_ms": 1790308800000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790164800000, "upper_boundary": "2699.53"}, {"description": "Possible reversal pattern, not a reversal: buy climax 2850.00 (bar 96), lower high 2786.81 (bar 107) versus 2804.59 (bar 99), hard bear bar 109, but no break of the 2568.16 higher low and a bull close on the last bar.", "end_time_ms": 1790337599999, "kind": "mtr-like", "lower_boundary": "2568.16", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Follow-through up: a further bull bar closing above 2740.42 and acceptance above 2700-2740 would confirm the range break as a bull-flag breakout and strengthen the channel/resumption read.", "Failure of the break: a bear bar closing back below 2699.53 would keep the 2633.31-2699.53 range intact and lower always-in relevance toward low.", "Loss of 2633.31 would put the 2568.16 higher low in play; a close below 2568.16 breaks the bull trend's higher-low sequence and shifts the read toward trading-range or transition.", "A strong bull bar closing above 2804.59 would put 2850.00 back in play and make the bull-trend read high confidence.", "Continued sideways trade between 2633.31 and 2699.53 with no new high would make the phase clearly range-bound and weaken the case that the final bar started a new leg."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2635.82", "close_time_ms": 1789923599999, "high": "2643.7", "low": "2605.96", "open": "2611", "open_time_ms": 1789920000000, "volume": "2239809.814"}, {"close": "2630.17", "close_time_ms": 1789927199999, "high": "2645.88", "low": "2624.89", "open": "2637.1", "open_time_ms": 1789923600000, "v